il possible d'entendre et de parler à travers la caméra ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="8e07d119-3faa-40c4-b715-d64529d882b1" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-586_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-587_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-589_">Grâce au système bi directionnel de la caméra vous pouvez entendre et parler depuis l'application.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-590_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-591_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="c47715d6-4529-4882-b18f-ae694b76e117" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Cette caméra peut-elle fonctionner avec un assistant vocale ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="c47715d6-4529-4882-b18f-ae694b76e117" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-593_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-594_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-596_">Cette caméra n'est pas compatible avec les assistants vocaux.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-597_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-598_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="82b18fae-694b-46e1-9707-154148e33f2d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Emplacement Carte SD</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="82b18fae-694b-46e1-9707-154148e33f2d" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-600_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-b1d9c53a0724-601_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-602_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jIkXHa iLIdP pf-b1d9c53a0724-603_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/carte-sd-w508mg-1660036392887.png?v=1660036395" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/carte-sd-w508mg-1660036392887.png?v=1660036395 1536w" width="3024" height="4032"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-604_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-605_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="e1170715-4148-433f-adc8-2f13f72006c5" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Puis-je enregistrer en continu avec cette caméra si je rajoute une carte SD ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e1170715-4148-433f-adc8-2f13f72006c5" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-607_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-b1d9c53a0724-608_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-609_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-610_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-612_">La carte SD vous permet de conserver les images enregistrées par la caméra lors d'une détection. <br><br>Cependant, les caméras autonomes ne permettent pas l'enregistrement <span style="font-weight: bold;">en continu</span> sur carte SD ( uniquement l'enregistrement de sequences videos en cas de détection de mouvement. ) Cela réduirait de manière drastique l'autonomie de la batterie si cette fonction était utilisée.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-613_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-614_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="c82f13f7-2006-45a4-b026-c244f064bf5f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Je n'arrive pas à obtenir le suivi de mouvement avec ma caméra</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="c82f13f7-2006-45a4-b026-c244f064bf5f" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-616_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-b1d9c53a0724-617_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-618_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-619_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-621_">Cette fonction n'est pas disponible sur les caméras autonomes. Seuls les modèles alimentés, comme la EP501 ou EP505, disposent de cette fonctionnalité.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/files/Manuel_complet_W508MG_compressed.pdf?v=1673881684" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-hBUSln jnBKKR pf-b1d9c53a0724-622_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-624_">Guide d'installation</span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-bjztik cXsdnb pf-b1d9c53a0724-625_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-b1d9c53a0724-626_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-627_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jIkXHa iLIdP pf-b1d9c53a0724-628_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/vision-nocture-3mp11-1654615261485.png?v=1654615263" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/vision-nocture-3mp11-1654615261485.png?v=1654615263 1536w" width="1600" height="1600" alt="Caméra IP505P"/></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-629_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-630_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-632_">Retrouvez le guide d'installation de l'EF505L et une section question réponse.</span></p><div class="sc-crHmcD fcHWeN pf-b1d9c53a0724-633_ pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-634_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-635_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="a4fe5d59-734a-498b-b0ad-60efca8074fc" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>La caméra doit-elle être branchée ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a4fe5d59-734a-498b-b0ad-60efca8074fc" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-637_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-638_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-640_">Oui cette caméra nécessite une alimentation secteur.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-641_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-642_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="8bb0ad60-efca-4074-bc66-0cbbbb3aa73b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Comment suis-je prévenu en cas d'intrusion ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="8bb0ad60-efca-4074-bc66-0cbbbb3aa73b" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a072