ication.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-662_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-663_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="d7fd477f-7d04-4b36-a711-166905959dc4" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Cette caméra peut-elle fonctionner avec un assistant vocale ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="d7fd477f-7d04-4b36-a711-166905959dc4" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-665_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-b1d9c53a0724-666_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-b1d9c53a0724-668_">Cette caméra n'est pas compatible avec les assistants vocaux.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-b1d9c53a0724-669_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-b1d9c53a0724-670_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="36a71116-6905-459d-8488-87521d6ea827" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Emplacement Carte SD</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="36a71116-6905-459d-8488-87521d6ea827" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-b1d9c53a0724-672_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-b1d9c53a0724-673_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-b1d9c53a0724-674_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jIkXHa iLIdP pf-b1d9c53a0724-675_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/ef505l-carte-sd-1659686876624.png?v=1659686879" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/ef505l-carte-sd-1659686876624.png?v=1659686879 1536w" width="3024" height="4032"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div d